\/h4><div style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/div><div><div style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><ol><li><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"helvetica\\\">Prices, specifications, and promotional offers on Multitech are subject to change at any time\\u00a0<\\/font><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">without prior notice. We strive for accuracy, but cannot guarantee that all product descriptions,\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">images, colors, sizes, or textures\\u00a0<\\/span>perfectly match the actual products, as variations may occur.\\u00a0<\\/font><\\/li><li><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\">Multitech is not liable for any typographical or photographic errors on the website. Some\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">images may be digitally enhanced or sourced from manufacturers or suppliers.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/li><li><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\">Stock availability can fluctuate. Even if a product is shown as \\u201cIn Stock,\\u201d it may become\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">unavailable due to demand or other factors.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/li><li><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\">While we make every effort to keep product information up to date and correct, we cannot\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">guarantee that all details, such as descriptions, photos, specifications, pricing, or compatibility\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">information, are always complete, accurate, or current. We disclaim any responsibility for errors\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">or omissions.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/li><\\/ol><\\/div><\\/div><div style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><font size=\\\"3\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/div><div style=\\\"text-align:justify;\\\"><font size=\\\"3\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><\\/font><h4><b><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\">Orders and Payments<\\/font><\\/b><\\/h4><div><b><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\" size=\\\"4\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/b><\\/div><div><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"helvetica\\\">By placing an order, you agree to provide accurate payment and shipping information. Product prices or\\u00a0<\\/font><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">stock availability may change at any time without prior notice. We reserve the right to cancel or reject\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">any order due to stock, pricing, or other reasons. Online payments are securely processed through\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">trusted third-party payment gateways. We do not store your payment card information.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/div><div><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/div><h4><b><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\">Shipping and Delivery<\\/font><\\/b><\\/h4><div><b><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/b><\\/div><div><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"helvetica\\\">If the product you ordered is in our stock and your payment has been completed, your order will be\\u00a0<\\/font><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">processed within 48-72 hours. We strive to deliver products on time; however, Multitech is not\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">responsible for any delays caused by the courier service provider or unexpected events during transit.\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">Ownership and risk transfer to you as soon as the product is handed over to the shipping provider.\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">Multitech reserves the right to cancel your order at any time without prior notice.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/div><div><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/div><h4><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><b>Returns, Refunds, and Cancellations<\\/b><\\/font><\\/h4><div><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><b><br \\/><\\/b><\\/font><\\/div><div><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"helvetica\\\">Please refer to our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/multitech.com.bd\\/policy\\/return-policy\\\" title=\\\"\\\">Return Policy<\\/a> for detailed information on returns and refunds.\\u00a0<\\/font><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">Cancellation requests must be made promptly. Once orders are processed or shipped, cancellations may\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">not be possible.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/div><div><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/div><h4><b><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\">Warranty Claim Conditions<\\/font><\\/b><\\/h4><div><b><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"helvetica\\\"><br \\/><\\/font><\\/b><\\/div><div><font size=\\\"4\\\" color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"helvetica\\\">The customer needs to provide proof of purchase (invoice, money receipt) to claim a warranty.\\u00a0<\\/font><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">The customer will pay return shipping charges for all warranty services. Multitech reserves the right to\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:helvetica;\\\">Refuse service to anyone.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"}', NULL, '2021-06-09 08:51:18', '2025-08-02 19:08:23'),
(7, NULL, NULL, 'maintenance.data', '{\"description\":\"<h2 class=\\\"text-center mb-3\\\">THE SITE IS UNDER MAINTENANCE<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h5 class=\\\"text-center\\\">We\'re just tuning up a few things.<\\/h5>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"text-center\\\">We apologize for the inconvenience but Front is currently undergoing planned maintenance. Thanks for your patience.<\\/p>\",\"image\":\"66f7cd8e217fb1727516046.png\"}', NULL, '2020-07-04 23:42:52', '2024-11-17 00:46:51'),
(8, 'basic', '', 'contact_page.content', '{\"address_heading\":\"We\'d Love to Hear From You\",\"form_heading\":\"Leave Us a Message\",\"description\":\"We appreciate feedback and interaction of any sort so please feel free to get in touch.\"}', NULL, '2022-11-22 10:40:36', '2025-05-21 17:58:59'),
(9, 'basic', '', 'faq_page.content', '{\"page_title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<b>1. How can I place an order?\\u00a0<\\/b><div>Browse our products, select the item you want, choose the quantity, and click \\\"Add to Cart.\\\" Once you\\u2019re ready to purchase, proceed to checkout, enter your shipping and payment information, and confirm your order.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>\\u00a02. What payment methods do you accept?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>We accept all major credit and debit cards, PayPal, Stripe, 2checkout, and more.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>\\u00a03. How can I track my order?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>You can track your order from our track you order page by order number.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>\\u00a04. What is your return policy?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>We offer a 30-day return policy for most items. If you\'re not satisfied with your purchase, you can return it for a full refund or exchange, as long as the item is in its original condition. Certain items, such as perishable goods or custom products, may not be eligible for return.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>5. How long will it take to receive my order?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>Standard shipping usually takes 5-7 business days, but we offer expedited shipping options at checkout if you need your order sooner. Delivery times may vary depending on your location and the selected shipping method.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>6. Can I change or cancel my order after placing it?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>You can cancel or make changes to your order within a limited time frame after it\\u2019s placed. Please contact our customer service team as soon as possible if you need to make changes.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>7. Do you ship internationally?<\\/b><\\/div><div>Yes, we offer international shipping to select countries. Shipping fees and delivery times vary based on the destination. Please check our Shipping Policy page for more details.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>8. How do I apply a discount code to my order?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>You can enter your discount code at checkout in the \\\"Promo Code\\\" field. Once applied, the discount will be reflected in your order total.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>9. Is my payment information secure?<\\/b><\\/div><div>Yes, we use secure encryption technology to protect your payment information and ensure a safe shopping experience. We do not store credit card details on our servers.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>10. What should I do if I receive a damaged or incorrect item?<\\/b><\\/div><div>If you receive a damaged or incorrect item, please get in touch with our customer service within 48 hours of receiving the order. We\\u2019ll arrange for a replacement or a refund as soon as possible.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>11. Can I create a wishlist?<\\/b><\\/div><div>Click the product page\'s heart icon to add items to your wishlist.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>12. What should I do if I forget my password?<\\/b><\\/div><div>If you forget your password, click \\\"Forgot Password\\\" on the login page. You\\u2019ll receive an email with instructions on how to reset it.\\u00a0<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><b>13. How can I contact customer support?\\u00a0<\\/b><\\/div><div>You can reach our customer support team via the contact form on our website or from the support menu for registered users. Our support team is available from.<br \\/><br \\/><b><i>Please note that these are dummy content for Visermart Script and should be customized according to your specific policies and offerings.<\\/i><\\/b><\\/div>\"}', NULL, '2022-11-22 11:22:50', '2024-11-10 06:44:16'),
